# 🛡 وِقاية — Wiqaya Preventive Health Platform

**AI-powered preventive healthcare app** built with Next.js 15, Supabase, and Claude AI.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Frontend | Next.js 15 (App Router) + TypeScript |
| Auth & DB | Supabase (Auth + PostgreSQL + Storage) |
| AI | Claude Sonnet (Anthropic API) |
| Deployment | Vercel |

